        <mxCell id="r14c1" value="信息" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#e2e2e2;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="658" width="364" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r15c0" value="2a. 来源不可信、内容不符或非最终结果：拒绝执行。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="700" width="680" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r15c1" value="拒绝原因" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="700" width="364" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r16c0" value="2b. 重复已成功通知：返回原结果，不重复授权；冲突最终结果拒绝。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="742" width="680" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r16c1" value="已有处理结果" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="742" width="364" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r17c0" value="3a. OA 最终驳回：记录驳回，不执行权限变更，结束本次处理。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="784" width="680" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r17c1" value="驳回结果及原因" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="784" width="364" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r18c0" value="3b. 原方案范围、目标条件、操作支持范围或版本已不合法（含停用后恢复）：标记失效，需重新申请。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="826" width="680" height="68" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r18c1" value="失效原因" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="826" width="364" height="68" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r19c0" value="4a. 暂时执行失败：整批不生效，保留批准依据；条件仍合法时自动重试。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="894" width="680" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r19c1" value="失败／待恢复状态" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="708" y="894" width="364" height="42" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="r20c0" value="其他：仅承接 UC-02～04，不实现 OA 内部审批。原申请人离任或公司暂时无专员不单独阻止执行；总管理员原申请按全局资格，专员原申请按公司范围复核。已批准方案不提供人为取消入口。批准不等于已生效。" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fontFamily=Microsoft YaHei;fontSize=17;fontColor=#111111;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;spacingTop=8;spacingBottom=8;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontStyle=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="28" y="936" width="1044" height="68" />
        </mxCell>
